      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The concern isn't just about feeling more sleepy; combining these medications can potentially cause increased sedation, respiratory depression, or dizziness in a more pronounced way. Each drug works on the body in different ways, and adding them together can amplify these effects beyond what you might anticipate. Because the specific dosage and your body's reaction are unknown, even a half dose cannot be safely advised without medical professional guidance.",
