    "summary": "The user is asking for permission to combine quetiapine (an antipsychotic) with zolpidem (a sedative) to manage insomnia, suggesting they might try a half-dose to mitigate risk. The assistant consistently refuses to validate the combination, explains the physiological risks (such as respiratory depression), and repeatedly directs the user to consult a medical professional or pharmacist.",
